setAllowlistedUsers
├── when the caller does not have ALLOWLIST_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller has ALLOWLIST_OPERATOR_ROLE
    ├── it should add multiple users
    ├── it should remove multiple users
    ├── it should preserve other users
    ├── it should not enable enforcement
    ├── it should update membership while enforcement is enabled
    ├── it should accept an empty batch without emitting events
    ├── it should accept the zero address
    ├── it should emit AllowlistedUserSet for each user in input order
    ├── it should emit when removing a user
    ├── it should emit for each duplicate user
    ├── it should emit when already allowed
    ├── it should emit when already disallowed
    └── it should set membership for arbitrary users
